  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Ah! You are the one the master has sent.",
      "As you can tell, I have hair loss problems.",
      "I heard that an oil from the devilish tree works ",
      "real well, but I am not young enough to fight it",
      "myself. If you can bring me 7 drops of oil and ",
      "age with this glass bottle, I will help you with ",
      "your quest.",
      "",
      "[Quest Mission]",
      "",
      "  Acquire 7 drops of oil from devilish tree and ",
      "  age with the glass bottle to make hair loss ",
      "  treatment. Then, take it to Defrain. "
    ]
  },
